  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nThe expression\n\nx4 - 15x3 + 15x2 - 15x + 40\n\nx=14\n\n**Concept used**:\n\nPutting the values\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nAfter putting the values \n\nx4 - 15x3 + 15x2 - 15x + 40\n\n⇒ (14)4 - 15×(14)3 + 15×(14)2 - 15×14 + 40\n\n⇒ 38416-41,160+2940-210+40\n\n⇒ 26\n\nHence the correct option is __**26**__.\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ca81259519cadfb2d5350673c220e419e60378e9770ad26512fc8e826a8d93f1.png] **__Shortcut Trick__**\n\nx4 - 15x3 + 15x2 - 15x + 40\n\n⇒ (14)4 - 15 × (14)3 + 15×(14)2 - 15×14 + 40\n\n⇒ (14)4 - (14 + 1) × (14)3 + (14 + 1)(14)2 - (14 + 1) 14 + 40\n\n⇒ (14)4 - (14)4 - (14)3 + 14³ + (14)2 - 14² - 14 + 40\n\n⇒ 26",
